  <name>Lumina Engine</name>
  <summary>A lightweight and versatile C++ game engine</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Lumina Engine is a modern, lightweight, and high-performance 2D game engine 
      developed in C++. Designed with modularity and ease of use in mind, it provides 
      a robust foundation for creating games and interactive applications.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>High-performance 2D rendering with SDL3</li>
      <li>Integrated Box2D physics engine</li>
      <li>Flexible Lua scripting support via sol2</li>
      <li>Entity Component System (ECS) with EnTT</li>
      <li>JSON serialization with nlohmann/json</li>
      <li>Cross-platform (Linux, Windows, macOS)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Perfect for hobbyists and indie developers looking for a simple yet powerful 
      engine to create 2D games.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.luminaengine.LuminaEngine.desktop</launchable>
